---
const title = "What Engineering Superhero Are You?";
const description = "Discover your engineering superhero archetype. Based on the First Round Review framework by Patrick Shields.";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:title" content={title} />
    <meta property="og:description" content="12 questions. 5 archetypes. No wrong answers." />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <!-- INTRO -->
      <section id="intro" class="screen active">
        <div class="container">
          <span class="badge">Engineering Archetype Quiz</span>
          <h1>What Engineering<br />Superhero Are You?</h1>
          <p class="lead">
            Every engineering team is a league of superheroes&mdash;each with
            unique powers that make the impossible possible.
          </p>
          <p class="sublead">
            Discover which of the five archetypes best describes your approach
            to building software.
          </p>
          <div class="quiz-meta">
            <span>12 questions</span>
            <span class="dot"></span>
            <span>5 archetypes</span>
            <span class="dot"></span>
            <span>~3 min</span>
          </div>
          <button id="start-btn" class="btn-primary">Discover Your Powers</button>
          <p class="credit">
            Based on
            <a
              href="https://review.firstround.com/how-to-spot-and-magnify-the-powers-of-your-engineering-superheroes/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
              How to Spot and Magnify the Powers of Your Engineering Superheroes
            </a>
            by <strong>Patrick Shields</strong>, via First Round Review.
            Built by <a href="https://imprescindibl.es" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>Joan Salvatella</strong></a>,
            founder of <a href="https://bookline.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Bookline.ai</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- QUIZ -->
      <section id="quiz" class="screen">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="progress-wrapper">
            <div class="progress-bar">
              <div id="progress-fill" class="progress-fill"></div>
            </div>
            <span id="progress-text" class="progress-text">1 / 12</span>
          </div>
          <div id="question-container" class="question-container">
            <h2 id="question-text" class="question-text"></h2>
            <div id="answers" class="answers"></div>
          </div>
          <button id="back-btn" class="btn-back">&larr; Previous question</button>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- RESULTS -->
      <section id="results" class="screen">
        <div class="container">
          <p class="results-eyebrow">Your engineering superpower is&hellip;</p>
          <div class="results-grid">
            <div id="hero-card" class="hero-card">
              <div class="hero-header">
                <div id="hero-icon" class="hero-icon"></div>
                <div class="hero-header-text">
                  <h2 id="hero-name" class="hero-name"></h2>
                  <p id="hero-tagline" class="hero-tagline"></p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p id="hero-description" class="hero-description"></p>
              <div id="hero-traits" class="hero-traits"></div>
              <blockquote id="hero-quote" class="hero-quote"></blockquote>
            </div>

            <div class="score-breakdown">
              <h3>Your archetype breakdown</h3>
              <div id="score-bars" class="score-bars"></div>

              <div class="share-section">
                <h3>Share your result</h3>
                <div class="share-grid">
                  <button id="share-linkedin" class="share-btn" aria-label="Share on LinkedIn">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="currentColor"><path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433c-1.144 0-2.063-.926-2.063-2.065 0-1.138.92-2.063 2.063-2.063 1.14 0 2.064.925 2.064 2.063 0 1.139-.925 2.065-2.064 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z"/></svg>
                    LinkedIn
                  </button>
                  <button id="share-download" class="share-btn share-btn-accent" aria-label="Download card image">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"/></svg>
                    Download
                  </button>
                </div>
                <p id="share-feedback" class="share-feedback"></p>
              </div>

              <button id="retake-btn" class="btn-secondary btn-retake">Retake Quiz</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <footer>
            <p>
              Based on the engineering superhero framework by
              <strong>Patrick Shields</strong>, originally published in
              <a
                href="https://review.firstround.com/how-to-spot-and-magnify-the-powers-of-your-engineering-superheroes/"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
              >First Round Review</a>.
            </p>
            <p class="footer-credit">
              Built by <a href="https://imprescindibl.es" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>Joan Salvatella</strong></a>,
              founder of <a href="https://bookline.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Bookline.ai</a>.
            </p>
            <p class="footer-license">
              Open source under the MIT License. Free to use, share, and adapt.
            </p>
          </footer>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  /* ── Reset & base ───────────────────────────────────── */
  *,
  *::before,
  *::after {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  html {
    color-scheme: dark;
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
  }

  body {
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto,
      Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    background: #060918;
    color: #e2e6f0;
    line-height: 1.6;
    min-height: 100dvh;
    overflow-x: hidden;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  a {
    color: #7ba4f7;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  /* ── Screens ────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .screen {
    display: none;
    min-height: 100dvh;
    padding: 2rem 1rem;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .screen.active {
    display: flex;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 680px;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* ── Intro ──────────────────────────────────────────── */
  #intro .container {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2rem 0;
  }

  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #8b8fa8;
    border: 1px solid #1e2140;
    padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6vw, 3.6rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e2e6f0 0%, #7ba4f7 50%, #a78bfa 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2.5vw, 1.25rem);
    color: #b0b4cc;
    max-width: 520px;
    margin: 0 auto 0.75rem;
  }

  .sublead {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #6b6f88;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .quiz-meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #6b6f88;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .dot {
    width: 3px;
    height: 3px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #3a3d56;
  }

  .credit {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #4e5170;
    max-width: 420px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }
  .credit a {
    color: #6b6f88;
  }
  .credit strong {
    color: #8b8fa8;
  }

  /* ── Buttons ────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .btn-primary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0.9rem 2.4rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #fff;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f6ef7, #7c5bf5);
    border: none;
    border-radius: 12px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: transform 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover {
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(79, 110, 247, 0.3);
  }
  .btn-primary:active {
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  .btn-secondary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0.9rem 2.4rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #b0b4cc;
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid #2a2d4a;
    border-radius: 12px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: border-color 0.15s, color 0.15s;
  }
  .btn-secondary:hover {
    border-color: #4e5170;
    color: #e2e6f0;
  }

  .btn-back {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #4e5170;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: color 0.15s;
  }
  .btn-back:hover {
    color: #8b8fa8;
  }
  .btn-back[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  /* ── Progress ───────────────────────────────────────── */
  .progress-wrapper {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .progress-bar {
    flex: 1;
    height: 4px;
    background: #1a1d35;
    border-radius: 999px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .progress-fill {
    height: 100%;
    width: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #4f6ef7, #a78bfa);
    border-radius: 999px;
    transition: width 0.4s ease;
  }

  .progress-text {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    color: #4e5170;
    white-space: nowrap;
    min-width: 3.5rem;
    text-align: right;
  }

  /* ── Question ───────────────────────────────────────── */
  .question-container {
    transition: opacity 0.25s, transform 0.25s;
  }
  .question-container.fade-out {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(8px);
  }

  .question-text {
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 3vw, 1.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  /* ── Answers — see <style is:global> below ──────────── */

  /* ── Results ────────────────────────────────────────── */
  #results {
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  #results .container {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 1rem 0;
    max-width: 960px;
  }

  .results-eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: #6b6f88;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .results-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 260px;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .hero-card {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    border: 1px solid #1e2140;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 1.75rem 2rem;
    text-align: left;
    transition: border-color 0.5s;
  }

  .hero-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .hero-header-text {
    text-align: left;
  }

  .hero-icon {
    font-size: 3rem;
    line-height: 1;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .hero-name {
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.2rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 0.1rem;
  }

  .hero-tagline {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #8b8fa8;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .hero-description {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: #b0b4cc;
    line-height: 1.65;
    max-width: 520px;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  }

  .hero-traits {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: flex-start;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  /* .trait-pill — see <style is:global> below */

  .hero-quote {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #6b6f88;
    border-left: 2px solid #2a2d4a;
    padding-left: 0.75rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ── Score breakdown ────────────────────────────────── */
  .score-breakdown {
    text-align: left;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid #1e2140;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 1.25rem;
  }
  .score-breakdown h3 {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: #6b6f88;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  /* ── Score bars — see <style is:global> below ────────── */

  /* ── Share ───────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .share-section {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #1e2140;
  }
  .share-section h3 {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: #6b6f88;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .share-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .btn-retake {
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    padding: 0.7rem 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  .share-btn {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.7rem 1rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #8b8fa8;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    border: 1px solid #1e2140;
    border-radius: 10px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.15s;
  }
  .share-btn:hover {
    border-color: #3a3d66;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    color: #e2e6f0;
  }
  .share-btn svg {
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .share-btn-accent {
    background: rgba(79, 110, 247, 0.06);
    border-color: rgba(79, 110, 247, 0.2);
    color: #7ba4f7;
  }
  .share-btn-accent:hover {
    background: rgba(79, 110, 247, 0.12);
    border-color: rgba(79, 110, 247, 0.35);
    color: #a4c0ff;
  }

  .share-feedback {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: #6b6f88;
    min-height: 1.2em;
  }

  /* ── Footer ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
  footer {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #1a1d35;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #4e5170;
    text-align: center;
  }
  footer strong {
    color: #6b6f88;
  }
  footer a {
    color: #6b6f88;
  }
  .footer-license {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  /* ── Responsive ─────────────────────────────────────── */
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .screen {
      padding: 1.5rem 1rem;
    }
    .hero-card {
      padding: 2rem 1.25rem;
    }
    .results-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .actions {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
    }
  }
</style>

<style is:global>
  /* Dynamically created elements need global styles (no Astro scoping) */

  .answers {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .answer-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1.1rem 1.4rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border-left: 3px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border-radius: 14px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #9498b5;
    text-align: left;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    user-select: none;
  }

  .answer-letter {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 1.7rem;
    height: 1.7rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: #4e5170;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    margin-top: 0.05rem;
  }

  .answer-text {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .answer-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    border-left-color: #4f6ef7;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    color: #e2e6f0;
    transform: translateX(2px);
  }
  .answer-card:hover .answer-letter {
    border-color: #4f6ef7;
    color: #7ba4f7;
    background: rgba(79, 110, 247, 0.08);
  }

  .answer-card.selected {
    border-color: rgba(79, 110, 247, 0.25);
    border-left-color: #4f6ef7;
    background: rgba(79, 110, 247, 0.06);
    color: #e2e6f0;
  }
  .answer-card.selected .answer-letter {
    background: #4f6ef7;
    border-color: #4f6ef7;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .answer-card:active {
    transform: scale(0.995);
  }

  /* ── Score bars (dynamically created) ────────────────── */
  .score-bars {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.9rem;
  }

  .score-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.3rem;
  }

  .score-row-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
  }

  .score-label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #8b8fa8;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .score-value {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    color: #4e5170;
  }

  .score-track {
    height: 6px;
    background: #1a1d35;
    border-radius: 999px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .score-bar {
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 999px;
    width: 0;
    transition: width 0.8s ease;
  }

  /* ── Trait pills (dynamically created) ─────────────── */
  .trait-pill {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid #2a2d4a;
    color: #b0b4cc;
  }
</style>

<script>
  document.documentElement.dataset.v = "2";
  // ── Archetype data ─────────────────────────────────────
  const heroes: Record<
    string,
    {
      name: string;
      icon: string;
      tagline: string;
      color: string;
      description: string;
      traits: string[];
      quote: string;
    }
  > = {
    aquaman: {
      name: "The Aquaman",
      icon: "\u{1F531}",
      tagline: "The Deep Diver",
      color: "#00b4d8",
      description:
        "You\u2019re driven by understanding how things work at the deepest level. While others see a bug, you see a mystery spanning the operating system, the database, and the application layer. You might not write code for weeks while investigating, but when you surface, you bring answers nobody else could find. Your singular focus and stamina make you the person the team turns to when a problem seems truly intractable.",
      traits: [
        "Systems Thinker",
        "Relentless Debugger",
        "Deep Focus",
        "Layer Fluent",
      ],
      quote:
        "\u201CThey\u2019re about how it works in a very deep way.\u201D \u2014 Patrick Shields",
    },
    flash: {
      name: "The Flash",
      icon: "\u26A1",
      tagline: "The Rapid Prototyper",
      color: "#ef233c",
      description:
        "\u201CLook at what I made!\u201D is your battle cry. You hear a problem in the afternoon and demo a solution by morning. You use whatever tools get the job done fastest and inspire through tangible progress. Your prototypes become the spark that ignites team momentum. Speed is your superpower, and you know that a working demo is worth a thousand architecture docs.",
      traits: [
        "Speed Builder",
        "Tool Agnostic",
        "Demo\u2011Driven",
        "Momentum Creator",
      ],
      quote:
        "\u201CThe Flash is interested in what\u2019s fast.\u201D \u2014 Patrick Shields",
    },
    priest: {
      name: "The Priest",
      icon: "\u{1F4DC}",
      tagline: "The Code Purist",
      color: "#9b5de5",
      description:
        "You\u2019re inspired by the beauty of well-structured code. APIs are legal contracts to you, and code reviews are sacred rituals. Your commitment to standards and abstractions means your code has fewer bugs from the start and is a pleasure for others to build upon. You elevate the craft of programming itself and bring intellectual rigor to everything you touch.",
      traits: [
        "Abstraction Master",
        "Standard Bearer",
        "Quality Guardian",
        "Clean Coder",
      ],
      quote:
